  "details": "So many creators, both world and avatar get mass friend requests from people they dont know, just because people look at the creator's creation, and friend them from there. It would be great to have a setting you can turn on and off (via the website too), so people can ONLY friend-request you when your in the same world together, so people dont just friend you any time, even when your offline.\n\n\"Request block\" user toggle.\n\nOntop of that, it would be good to have the option to \"block friend requests\" from strangers that keep trying to friend you, without you having to just full on block them; sometimes I just don't wanna friend them, but they just spam with requests, so I have no choice but to block.\n\nThis \"request block\" could also work for friends, if you just have that once friend you don't know too well always inviting you to random world any time they see you online and spamming with invites.\n\nJust a simple button on someone's profile that makes it so (not friends) cant friend request you, and (friends) cant invite you or request an invite from you.",
